<title>CHINA: BZW SETS WARRANTS ON HANG SENG BANK.</title>
<headline>BZW SETS WARRANTS ON HANG SENG BANK.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it has launched 32 million American style call warrants on shares of Hang Seng Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$101.175    PREMIUM	 13.88 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$2.0108     GEARING	 5.30x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 12.AUG.97     LISTING DATE  04.SEPT.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  12.JUN.98     PAYDATE	 02.SEPT.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG     MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$106.50</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT THE OPTION OF</p>
<p>			 ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
